      "message": "```\nOne more thing... The other generic targets mentioned above requires some sort of software stack to run.\nRecently, we have introduced a pretty different\n(generic target)[https://github.com/LineageOS/android_device_mainline_generic/tree/lineage-24.0/docs],\nwhich allows to run on various bare metal hardware.\nWhile it\u0027s still in experimental state, it has successfully booted on these devices:\n- Apple Silicon Macs\n- Common x86_64 PCs\n- NVIDIA DGX Spark\n- Qualcomm Snapdragon X Series Laptops\n- Some ARM64 boxes that were discontinued by its vendor\n```",
